{
    "id":  11067,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "RF Remote Control for LED Single Color + RGB + CCT + 4 Zones",
    "reference":  "92062-FUT092",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eRGB + CCT 4-Zone Remote Control\u003c/strong\u003e is the perfect solution for efficiently managing the lighting in your spaces. \u003cstrong\u003eIt allows you to regulate color, saturation, brightness, and color temperature (from warm to cool) across up to 4 different zones\u003c/strong\u003e, with the flexibility to create groups and combinations as needed. Its intuitive design includes a rotary wheel and touch bars, facilitating precise adjustment. With a transmission distance of 30 meters and 2.4GHz RF technology, it ensures fast, interference-free control, ideal for any environment.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRF Remote Control for LED Single Color + RGB + CCT + 4 zones\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \"Mi-Light\" RGB+CCT 4 zones remote control offers total control over residential or commercial lighting. Independently manages up to 4 zones, adjusting color, saturation, brightness, and color temperature precisely.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMain Features:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor and Brightness Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Rotary wheel for color adjustment, touch bars for saturation and brightness.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Temperature (CCT) Adjustment:\u003c/strong\u003e Warm to cool white tones.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-zone Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 4 zones, independent or combined.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eTechnology and Range:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2.4GHz RF Transmission:\u003c/strong\u003e Stable signal, 30m range, through walls and ceilings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnti-interference System:\u003c/strong\u003e Efficient uninterrupted transmission.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEase of Use:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Rotary wheel and touch bars. On/off buttons, mode buttons.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZone Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Each zone requires its own Mi-Light controller.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eInstallation and Compatibility:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with Mi-Light and Miboxer RGB+CCT products at 2.4GHz frequency.\u003c/p\u003e",
